### Q-01 Create help request (senior) -> 201 + dispatch
POST {{host}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "medical_transport",
  "description": "Need a ride to the hospital for a checkup",
  "latitude": {{lat}},
  "longitude": {{lng}},
  "priority": "normal",
  "source": "flutter_app"
}

### Q-01 Urgent help request
POST {{host}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "first_aid",
  "description": "Feeling chest pain, need immediate assistance",
  "latitude": {{lat}},
  "longitude": {{lng}},
  "priority": "urgent",
  "source": "voice_agent"
}

### Q-01 Duplicate open request -> 409 REQUEST_ALREADY_OPEN
POST {{host}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "daily_errands",
  "description": "Need help getting groceries",
  "latitude": {{lat}},
  "longitude": {{lng}},
  "priority": "normal",
  "source": "flutter_app"
}

### Q-02 List my requests (senior)
GET {{host}}/api/requests/me
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}

### Q-02 List my requests (volunteer)
GET {{host}}/api/requests/me
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}

### Q-03 Get request detail (senior)
GET {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}

###! Q-03 Get request detail (police)
GET {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{policeToken}}

### Q-04 Nearby requests (volunteer)
GET {{host}}/api/requests/nearby?lat={{lat}}&lng={{lng}}&radius_m={{radiusM}}
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}

### Q-05 Accept request (volunteer) -> first-wins
PATCH {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}

### Q-06 Update status to IN_PROGRESS (assigned volunteer only)
PATCH {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS"
}

### Q-06 Mark request COMPLETED (assigned volunteer)
PATCH {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

### Q-06 Invalid status -> 400
PATCH {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CANCELLED"
}

### Q-07 Cancel request (senior, only before ACCEPTED)
PATCH {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}

### Q-08 Get assigned volunteer contact (senior, after ACCEPTED)
GET {{host}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}/volunteer
Authorization: Bearer {{seniorToken}}

### Role guard: volunteer cannot create requests -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{volunteerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category": "test",
  "description": "Should fail",
  "latitude": {{lat}},
  "longitude": {{lng}},
  "priority": "normal",
  "source": "flutter_app"
}